		<item>
		<title>
		By: nursesrevision@gmail.com		</title>
		<link>https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/acute-pericarditis/#comment-411</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[nursesrevision@gmail.com]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 02 Aug 2023 05:10:57 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/?p=3972#comment-411</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[In reply to &lt;a href=&quot;https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/acute-pericarditis/#comment-410&quot;&gt;Mugume Ivan&lt;/a&gt;.

Thanks, however, instead of &quot;In relation&quot;, opt for &quot;Related to&quot; and also, relate it to the CAUSE, not the condition, such as &quot;Related to disturbance of the thermoregulatory centers on the brain&quot; and also add Degrees on 39.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In reply to <a href="https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/acute-pericarditis/#comment-410">Mugume Ivan</a>.</p>
<p>Thanks, however, instead of &#8220;In relation&#8221;, opt for &#8220;Related to&#8221; and also, relate it to the CAUSE, not the condition, such as &#8220;Related to disturbance of the thermoregulatory centers on the brain&#8221; and also add Degrees on 39.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
			</item>
